<newsitem itemid="192218" id="root" date="1996-11-15" xml:lang="en">
<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Slovnaft posts 9 month SKK 1.37bln gross profit.</title>
<headline>Slovak Slovnaft posts 9 month SKK 1.37bln gross profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for nine-month period ending September 30, 1996 (in billion crowns):</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		  1.374		3.429</p>
<p> After-tax profit		0.825		2.057</p>
<p> Operating revenues	   27.103		26.196</p>
<p> Operating costs		25.439		22.815</p>
<p> Operating profit		1.663		 3.380</p>
<p>Revenues from financial</p>
<p>  operations		     0.593		 0.417</p>
<p> Financial costs		 0.879		 0.406</p>
<p>Result of financial</p>
<p>  operations		     0.286 loss	  0.011 profit</p>
<p>Profit from regular</p>
<p>  activities		     1.377		 3.391</p>
<p> Total sales		    23.701	     24.008</p>
<p> Total exports		  12.368	     12.059</p>
<p> Basic capital		  16.469	     16.469</p>
<p> Total assets		   34.741	     33.949</p>
<p>Revenues profitability</p>
<p>  (pct)			    2.98		 7.72</p>
<p>Own capital</p>
<p>  profitability (pct)	  3.42		 8.35</p>
<p> Loan burden (pct)	    25.59	     13.04</p>
<p> Overall debt (pct)	   30.16	     23.84</p>
<p>Volume of crude oil</p>
<p>  processed (million tonnes) 3.809		3.768</p>
<p>Note - Full company name is Slovnaft a.s. It is Slovakia's sole crude oil refiner. It controls around 80 percent of the domestic petrol station market. The company shut 70 percent of its refining capacity from early March to end-April to complete major maintenence. Results are provided by the Bratislava Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
